WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:06.640
Meet SCP-2662, also known as Cthulhu. Believe&nbsp;
us, he’s really not what you’re expecting.

00:00:06.640 --> 00:00:11.280
The primary anomalous effect of Cthulhu is warping&nbsp;
the minds of random civilians out there in the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:15.920
world, and causing them to independently&nbsp;
form highly dangerous and depraved cults.

00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:20.000
These cults will do everything they can to&nbsp;
break into the low-security humanoid wing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:26.240
where SCP-2662 is contained in an attempt to&nbsp;
free him, and also perform depraved blood and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:32.080
sex rituals in his name. The SCP Foundation has&nbsp;
consistently been unable to stop them getting in.

00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:35.680
The problem is, at only a few hundred&nbsp;
years old, Cthulhu is practically a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:35.680 --> 00:00:39.920
teenager by his own standards. He isn’t&nbsp;
interested in joining any of these cults,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:39.920 --> 00:00:43.680
and in fact finds them pretty creepy&nbsp;
and disgusting. He submitted himself&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:43.680 --> 00:00:48.640
for Foundation containment voluntarily, and they&nbsp;
keep him safe from the weirdos who worship him.

